    {
      "id": "4B50CFC15772EED2",
      "title": "Multilayer circuit etching",
      "subtitle": "Verify connectivity and insulation of existing layers",
      "description": "[
        \"After obtaining the substrate growth and soul steel processing records, the existing substrate and etching layer were sent for inspection. The original quantity of the inspected object was returned, and then the multi-layer circuit etching project was completed at the research institute.\",
        \"After the experiment is completed, choose 210 research points or MAX circuit × 2, steel plate × 48 to pay the base fee; an additional 3,000 ticks and 128,849,018,880 EU/t are required. The current material pressure is corrected for advanced.\",
        \"The institute withholds power based on the total power of the effective energy port. After completion, the multi-layer circuit etching working condition of the Soul Steel Precision Machining Center will be unlocked; the first-time packaging can use the front-end GTL process, and there is no need to complete the circuit packaging and working condition test research first.\"
      ]",
