    {
      "id": "4B5DF2FDA879723E",
      "title": "Advanced Materials Research Institute Engineering",
      "subtitle": "Completed real load and interface testing at the Collapse Phenomenon Research Institute",
      "description": "[
        \"Put the etched layer, soul steel plate, soul steel thin wire and HRV sensor into the Collapse Phenomenon Research Institute and conduct a constraint load boundary test. After the continuous power supply is completed and the test is completed, the original quantities of the four types of samples will be returned; after completing the project, the Material Reconstruction Research Institute can be created.\",
        \"After the experiment is completed, choose 210 research points or MAX circuit × 2, steel plate × 48 to pay the base fee; an additional 3,000 ticks and 128,849,018,880 EU/t are required. The current material pressure is corrected for advanced.\",
        \"The research institute deducts power according to the total power of the effective energy port. After completion, the second-level research institute is unlocked; the Material Reconstruction Research Institute is not required to research its own construction materials first.\"
      ]",
