      "id": "4B5F2FBB98E65C9E",
      "title": "imitation core crystal",
      "subtitle": "RN-CCE · Experimental and Formal Research",
      "description": "[
        \"Test object: Collapse crystal seed × 1; paper 2 is used for test records, and the reference sample is recycled\",
        \"Complete the team's experiment at the Honkai Energy Sample Spectral Analysis Array. The real crystallized sample has been tested for composition and lattice to form a valid receipt; the test crystal does not have core capabilities; the original quantity of the tested object is returned, and the experiment is subject to the actual settlement of the machine\",
        \"After the experiment is completed, choose 580 research points or HDV circuit × 4, tungsten steel plate × 56 to pay the base fee; an additional 7,200 ticks and 515,396,075,520 EU/t are required. The current material pressure is corrected for advanced.\",
        \"The institute deducts power according to the total power of the effective energy port. After completion, the basic crystal of the imitation core crystal reaction chamber will be unlocked, and then different functions will be defined by various core topics.\"
      ]",
