      "subtitle": "RN-CFR · Experimental and Formal Research",
      "description": "[
        \"Liquid fuel and existing concentrated consumables can be obtained after HFB\",
        \"The team's experiment was completed at the enriched Honkai energy fuel refinery. The actual output of the existing enrichment formula was successfully submitted; the evidence can be recorded in advance, and the formal study still checks SSC, HFB and FRP\",
        \"After the experiment is completed, choose 580 research points or HDV circuit × 4, tungsten steel plate × 56 to pay the base fee; an additional 7,200 ticks and 515,396,075,520 EU/t are required. The current material pressure is corrected for advanced.\",
        \"The institute withholds power based on the total power of the effective energy port. After completion, the liquid initial enrichment can be operated after fuel preparation research; after completing this topic, the routes for enriched fuel rods and fuel cores of seven high-end materials will be opened.\"
